{"id":"93bcfaaefa338233","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology.md","title":"Ajtai–Fagin 不可表达性判据","display":"thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology — Ajtai–Fagin 不可表达性判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology","aliases":["29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology"],"display":"thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology — Ajtai–Fagin 不可表达性判据","depends_on":["[[29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]]","[[29-df-monadic-eso]]","[[29-thm-monadic-so-game]]","[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 8.5 and proof, pp.127–128, DjVu scans 142–143","source_basis":"原书陈述与双向证明已阅读；相对论域版本另有本条完整的有限类型论证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology — Ajtai–Fagin 不可表达性判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"688a1b544d81033c\" href=\"?note=688a1b544d81033c\" title=\"29-df-ajtai-fagin-game\">29-df-ajtai-fagin-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cf492b2a5223a49a\" href=\"?note=cf492b2a5223a49a\" title=\"29-df-monadic-eso\">29-df-monadic-eso</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"75c22d8e0af45459\" href=\"?note=75c22d8e0af45459\" title=\"29-thm-monadic-so-game\">29-thm-monadic-so-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0539a14219495918\" href=\"?note=0539a14219495918\" title=\"29-thm-ef-game-fo\">29-thm-ef-game-fo</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 8.5 and proof, pp.127–128, DjVu scans 142–143"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书陈述与双向证明已阅读；相对论域版本另有本条完整的有限类型论证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq K\">\\(I\\subseteq K\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 同构封闭且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 中同构不变，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"688a1b544d81033c\" href=\"?note=688a1b544d81033c\" title=\"29-df-ajtai-fagin-game\">29-df-ajtai-fagin-game</a> 的输入条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)\">\\(\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K]\\)</span> 见所列依赖。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ I\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ I\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 8.5，印刷页127–128、扫描页142–143；扫描页143图像复核了集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 和反向构造。已阅读两个方向。以下同时说明把原书全结构域改成显式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的依据。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(\\exists\\bar C_c)\\varphi\">\\(\\Phi=(\\exists\\bar C_c)\\varphi\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 中定义，Samson 选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 与不小于矩阵秩的正数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>。对 Delilah 给的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in I\">\\(A\\in I\\)</span>，他取使矩阵为真的着色。任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in K\\setminus I\">\\(B\\in K\\setminus I\\)</span> 及其任意着色都使矩阵为假，FO 游戏定理给出 Samson 的胜法，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AFWin}\">\\(\\operatorname{AFWin}\\)</span> 不成立。</p>\n<p>反向，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,m\">\\(c,m\\)</span>。有限关系词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_c\">\\(\\tau_c\\)</span> 中只有有限多个秩至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的完整句子类型；为每个类型选一个同秩特征句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>。把所有满足下述条件的类型收集起来：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 中，任何能以某着色实现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 的结构都属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>。这些类型的存在二阶封闭的有限析取记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span>，空析取用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\,(x\\ne x)\">\\(\\exists x\\,(x\\ne x)\\)</span>。同一前缀的存在关系量词与有限析取可交换，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 仍属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]\\)</span>。它在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 中蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 不可表达，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in I\">\\(A\\in I\\)</span> 不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的任意着色，其完整类型不在所收集的坏类型中，于是存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in K\\setminus I\">\\(B\\in K\\setminus I\\)</span> 及着色实现相同类型。FO 游戏定理遂给出最后阶段的 Delilah 胜法，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 可以依赖刚才的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 着色，正好符合 Ajtai–Fagin 顺序。</p>\n<p>论证在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=K\">\\(I=K\\)</span> 时仍相容：这两个相对查询可由矛盾句或恒真句表达，游戏中则缺少一方所需的结构。所用有限类型原理与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75c22d8e0af45459\" href=\"?note=75c22d8e0af45459\" title=\"29-thm-monadic-so-game\">29-thm-monadic-so-game</a> 相同；没有把一般二阶类型误当作有限个。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ajtai-fagin-game","status":"resolved","id":"688a1b544d81033c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-monadic-eso","status":"resolved","id":"cf492b2a5223a49a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-monadic-eso]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-monadic-so-game","status":"resolved","id":"75c22d8e0af45459","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-monadic-so-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-ef-game-fo","status":"resolved","id":"0539a14219495918","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ajtai-fagin-game","status":"resolved","id":"688a1b544d81033c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 为有限关系词汇；$K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，$I\\subseteq K$，$K$ 同构封闭且 $I$ 在 $K$ 中同构不变，满足 [[29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]] 的输入条件。","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-monadic-so-game","status":"resolved","id":"75c22d8e0af45459","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"论证在 $I=\\varnothing$ 或 $I=K$ 时仍相容：这两个相对查询可由矛盾句或恒真句表达，游戏中则缺少一方所需的结构。所用有限类型原理与 [[29-thm-monadic-so-game]] 相同；没有把一般二阶类型误当作有限个。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AFWin}_{\\tau}(I;K)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ I\\notin Q(\\mathrm M\\Sigma_1)[\\tau;K].","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi=(\\exists\\bar C_c)\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in K\\setminus I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AFWin}","display":false},{"tex":"c,m","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_c","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\,(x\\ne x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm M\\Sigma_{c,m}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in K\\setminus I","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"I=K","display":false}],"bytes":2761,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ajtai-fagin-game]]、[[29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology]]、[[29-thm-monadic-connectivity]] — Ajtai–Fagin 判据、无序与仅带序的连通性下界"},{"id":"688ab84b1bfdaffd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology]]"},{"id":"08f453008a616925","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology|29-thm-ajtai-fagin-methodology]]"}],"outgoing":["688a1b544d81033c","cf492b2a5223a49a","75c22d8e0af45459","0539a14219495918"]}